sequenceDiagram
  participant developer as Developer
  participant dev as dev branch CI
  participant promotion as Promotion workflow
  participant review as CODEOWNER / reviewer
  participant main as main branch
  participant release as Release workflow
  developer->>dev: Commit and push reviewed work
  dev->>promotion: Run full technical CI and classify changed risk
  promotion->>review: Request fresh CODEOWNER approval for sensitive changes
  review-->>promotion: Approve sensitive promotion
  promotion->>main: Merge dev to main only after required gate
  developer->>release: Create version tag and explicitly dispatch publish
  release->>main: Verify version, checks, integration, and images
  release-->>developer: Publish images and generated-notes GitHub Release when requested
